    <briefdescription>
<para>The opacity of an item over the time since it started, built from opacity animations. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>At a given time, the segment that started last applies; segments that start together apply in their order. Before the first segment, the item shows that segment&apos;s start opacity, and an item without segments is opaque. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
